msgstr "已启用 controller 标志 ``--enable-runtime-sidecar=true``"

#: ../../source/features/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:682
msgid "Kubernetes secrets configured with storage credentials"
msgstr "已配置含存储凭据的 Kubernetes Secret"

